        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: حملہ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حملہ — hamlā — \"an attack\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فوج نے رات کو حملہ کیا۔ fauj ne rāt ko hamlā kiyā. The army attacked at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حملہ (hamlā) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic ḥamla, \"a charge, an onset\". حملہ کیا is attacked."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
